    `the statement gives objective factual information based on those standards regarding the corporation's success in meeting the objectives` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the statement gives an assessment of the corporation's success in meeting the objectives and promoting the public benefit or public benefits and interests` IS A BOOLEAN

