-- src:1811 | (b) A public benefit corporation shall no less than biennially provide its stockholders with a statement as to the corporation’s promotion of the public benefit or public benefits identified in the certificate of incorporation and of the best interests of those materially affected by the corporation’s conduct. The statement shall include:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 366(b) (src:1811)
GIVEN statement IS A `s 366(b) Statement to the stockholders`
