    AND `s 366(b)(4) the statement includes an assessment of the corporation's success` statement

-- (c)(1): the certificate or bylaws may require the statement more frequently than biennially. Only a provision in
-- the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws counts, and only a shorter interval than 24 months.
-- src:1816 | (c) The certificate of incorporation or bylaws of a public benefit corporation may require that the corporation:
-- src:1817 | (1) Provide the statement described in subsection (b) of this section more frequently than biennially;
@ref 8 Del. C. § 366(c)(1) (src:1816-1817)
GIVEN `where the provision requiring a more frequent statement is made` IS A `Where a provision is made`
      `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 366(c)(1) the number of months between statements` `where the provision requiring a more frequent statement is made` `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` MEANS
    CONSIDER `where the provision requiring a more frequent statement is made`
    WHEN `in the certificate of incorporation` THEN (IF `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` LESS THAN 24 THEN `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` ELSE 24)
    WHEN `in the bylaws` THEN (IF `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` LESS THAN 24 THEN `the number of months between statements that the provision requires` ELSE 24)
    OTHERWISE 24

-- (b): "no less than biennially": the next statement is due within the interval after the last one. The text does not
-- say from when the first statement is counted (fork F22), so where there has been none the date is not covered.
-- src:1811 | A public benefit corporation shall no less than biennially provide its stockholders with a statement as to the corporation’s promotion of the public benefit or public benefits identified in the certificate of incorporation and of the best interests of those materially affected by the corporation’s conduct. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 366(b) (src:1811)
GIVEN `the date the last statement was provided` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the number of months between statements` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 366(b) the last day for the next statement` `the date the last statement was provided` `the number of months between statements` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date the last statement was provided`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST last THEN JUST (`the date` (`period in months` `the number of months between statements`) `after` last)

-- src:1811 | A public benefit corporation shall no less than biennially provide its stockholders with a statement as to the corporation’s promotion of the public benefit or public benefits identified in the certificate of incorporation and of the best interests of those materially affected by the corporation’s conduct. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 366(b) (src:1811)
GIVEN `the date the last statement was provided` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the number of months between statements` IS A NUMBER
      `the date the next statement was provided` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 366(b) the next statement was provided in time` `the date the last statement was provided` `the number of months between statements` `the date the next statement was provided` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 366(b) the last day for the next statement` `the date the last statement was provided` `the number of months between statements`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST lastDay THEN JUST (`the date the next statement was provided` AT MOST lastDay)

-- (c)(2) and (c)(3): provisions the certificate or bylaws may add.
-- src:1818 | (2) Make the statement described in subsection (b) of this section available to the public; and/or
@ref 8 Del. C. § 366(c)(2) (src:1818)
GIVEN `where the provision requiring the statement to be made available to the public is made` IS A `Where a provision is made`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 366(c)(2) the corporation must make the statement available to the public` `where the provision requiring the statement to be made available to the public is made` MEANS
    CONSIDER `where the provision requiring the statement to be made available to the public is made`
    WHEN `in the certificate of incorporation` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `in the bylaws` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

