GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 366(c)(3) the corporation must use a third-party standard or attain a periodic third-party certification` `where the provision requiring a third-party standard or certification is made` MEANS
    CONSIDER `where the provision requiring a third-party standard or certification is made`
    WHEN `in the certificate of incorporation` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `in the bylaws` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

§§ `s 367 Suits to enforce the requirements of s 365(a) of this title`

-- "may not be brought unless the plaintiffs in such action own individually or collectively, as of the date of
-- instituting such action, at least 2% of the corporation's outstanding shares or, in the case of a corporation with
-- shares listed on a national securities exchange, the lesser of such percentage or shares of the corporation with a
-- market value of at least $2,000,000 as of the date the action is instituted." A plaintiff group of a listed
-- corporation meets the threshold by either measure (fork F23). A corporation with no outstanding shares gives no
-- percentage: not covered.
-- src:1823 | Any action to enforce the balancing requirement of § 365(a) of this title, including any individual, derivative or any other type of action, may not be brought unless the plaintiffs in such action own individually or collectively, as of the date of instituting such action, at least 2% of the corporation’s outstanding shares or, in the case of a corporation with shares listed on a national securities exchange, the lesser of such percentage or shares of the corporation with a market value of at least $2,000,000 as of the date the action is instituted. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 367 (src:1823)
GIVEN `the number of shares the plaintiffs own individually or collectively as of the date of instituting the action` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A NUMBER
      `the corporation has shares listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN  -- listing is a matter of the exchange rules: not among the inputs
      `the market value in dollars of the plaintiffs' shares as of the date the action is instituted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 367 the plaintiffs own enough shares to bring the action` `the number of shares the plaintiffs own individually or collectively as of the date of instituting the action` `the number of the corporation's outstanding shares` `the corporation has shares listed on a national securities exchange` `the market value in dollars of the plaintiffs' shares as of the date the action is instituted` MEANS
    IF `the number of the corporation's outstanding shares` AT MOST 0
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (    `the number of shares the plaintiffs own individually or collectively as of the date of instituting the action` AT LEAST (2% TIMES `the number of the corporation's outstanding shares`)
               OR (    `the corporation has shares listed on a national securities exchange`
                   AND `the market value in dollars of the plaintiffs' shares as of the date the action is instituted` AT LEAST 2_000_000))

-- "This section shall not relieve the plaintiffs from complying with any other conditions applicable to filing a
-- derivative action including s 327 of this title and any rules of the court in which the action is filed."
-- src:1823 | This section shall not relieve the plaintiffs from complying with any other conditions applicable to filing a derivative action including § 327 of this title and any rules of the court in which the action is filed.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 367 (src:1823)
GIVEN `the plaintiffs own enough shares under s 367` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the action is a derivative action` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the complaint contains the averment of stock ownership that s 327 requires` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the plaintiffs comply with any other conditions, including the rules of the court in which the action is filed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 367 the plaintiffs may bring the action to enforce the balancing requirement` `the plaintiffs own enough shares under s 367` `the action is a derivative action` `the complaint contains the averment of stock ownership that s 327 requires` `the plaintiffs comply with any other conditions, including the rules of the court in which the action is filed` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the plaintiffs own enough shares under s 367`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST enough THEN JUST (    enough
                                AND ((NOT `the action is a derivative action`) OR `the complaint contains the averment of stock ownership that s 327 requires`)
                                AND `the plaintiffs comply with any other conditions, including the rules of the court in which the action is filed`)

§§ `s 368 No effect on other corporations`

-- "This subchapter shall not affect a statute or rule of law that is applicable to a corporation that is not a public
-- benefit corporation, except as provided in s 363 of this title." For a public benefit corporation the section does
-- not speak: not covered.
-- src:1827 | This subchapter shall not affect a statute or rule of law that is applicable to a corporation that is not a public benefit corporation, except as provided in § 363 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 368 (src:1827)
GIVEN `the corporation is a public benefit corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statute or rule of law is one that s 363 provides for` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 368 this subchapter affects the statute or rule of law applicable to the corporation` `the corporation is a public benefit corporation` `the statute or rule of law is one that s 363 provides for` MEANS
    IF `the corporation is a public benefit corporation`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST `the statute or rule of law is one that s 363 provides for`
